WEBVTT

00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:31.339
vivos,

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.497
e, esperamos,

00:12:34.419 --> 00:12:35.805
inspirados.

00:12:36.323 --> 00:12:37.383
Obrigada.

00:12:38.028 --> 00:12:40.028
(Aplausos)

00:12:44.742 --> 00:12:48.043
(Música "Right on. Be free."
de East Harlem)

00:12:59.994 --> 00:13:03.270
♪ Quero ir aonde o vento do norte sopra ♪